sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Script (requests.Session)
    participant N as Nexus NX-API REST
    participant D as DME
    P->>N: POST /api/aaaLogin.json<br/>{"aaaUser": {"attributes": {"name": "admin", "pwd": "…"}}}
    N-->>P: 200 · imdata[0].aaaLogin.attributes.token<br/>Set-Cookie: APIC-cookie=#lt;token#gt;
    P->>N: GET /api/mo/sys/intf/phys-[eth1/5].json · Cookie: APIC-cookie
    N->>D: look up DN
    N-->>P: 200 · {"totalCount": "1", "imdata": [{"l1PhysIf": {"attributes": {…}}}]}
    P->>N: POST /api/mo/sys/bd.json · Cookie<br/>{"bdEntity": {"children": [{"l2BD": {"attributes": {"fabEncap": "vlan-40"}}}]}}
    N->>D: create / merge child MO
    N-->>P: 200 · {"imdata": []}
    P->>N: DELETE /api/mo/sys/bd/bd-[vlan-40].json · Cookie
    N-->>P: 200
    P->>N: GET /api/mo/sys/bd/bd-[vlan-40].json
    N-->>P: 200 · totalCount "0" · imdata [] (not a 404)
    Note over P,D: token expires (refreshTimeoutSeconds 600) → POST /api/aaaRefresh.json or log in again
